OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Flargely dry with some clear spells,
OL,7,Fallowing for a frost to form
OL,8,Fovernight, sharp in the west. There is
OL,9,Fa chance of the odd shower for Angus
OL,10,Fand the Fife Coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA frosty start, then another
OL,13,Fmostly dry day with sunny spells,
OL,14,Fthough the odd shower is possible in
OL,15,Fin Angus possible at first.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
